solution.p:
The opposite action to addition is subtraction.
\begin{aligned}
{{\frac{8}{9}}+u} \amp= {{\frac{2}{3}}}\\
{{\frac{8}{9}}+u}\subtractright{{{\frac{8}{9}}}} \amp= {{\frac{2}{3}}}\subtractright{{{\frac{8}{9}}}}\\
u \amp= {-{\frac{2}{9}}}
\end{aligned}
The solution set is {\left\{\frac{-2}{9}\right\}}\text{.}
